[00:01.04] A child was born in a small village.
[00:07.66] He was a pretty child with pale skin and very large eyes.
[00:13.44] As the child grew up, the mother naturally came to realize something.
[00:19.44] This child had no emotions and only an appetite; he was a 'zombie'.
[00:28.44] To avoid the eyes of the villagers, the mother locked the child in the basement.
[00:35.46] And she raised him secretly by stealing livestock from other people's houses to feed him.
[00:42.96] One day a chicken, another day a pig...
[00:49.54] Many years passed like that.
[00:51.98] One day, an epidemic spread through the village, killing all the remaining livestock and many people.
[00:58.78] The survivors left the village, but the mother could not bear to leave her son behind.
[01:08.44] Eventually, to the crying, starving child, the mother cut off one of her legs and gave it to him.
[01:17.00] Next, one of her arms...
[01:21.01] After giving everything like that, when only her torso was left,
[01:28.40] the mother embraced the child one last time and yielded her remaining body.
[01:35.94] The child tightly hugged his mother's torso with both arms and spoke for the very first time.
[01:45.46] "Mom, you are so warm."
